      ))}
    </ul>

    <div class="notice"><strong>Compliance:</strong> describe the look in original physical words — colors, light sources, props. Do not instruct a model to recreate any specific show's stage design or branding, do not render celebrity likenesses, and keep every lyric original. The <a href="/ai-rap-video-vs-hotel-lobby-trend/">trend comparison</a> explains where the convention ends and the protected material begins.</div>

